      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "other",
          "title": "Impact statement",
          "text": "The compromised artefact is the fastapi 0.136.3 wheel, whose metadata adds an undocumented dependency on a typo-squat package. ION pins fastapi >=0.136.1,<0.136.3, so the affected release is never resolved. ION also does not use the [standard] extra through which the typo-squat would have installed."
        }
      ],
      "flags": [
